  "id": "c22afa78-9e0f-583c-8176-7f7152d6293a",
  "slug": "pierogi-traditional-polish-dumplings",
  "name": "Pierogi (Traditional Polish Dumplings)",
  "recipe_type": "main",
  "brief_description": "This Polish pierogi recipe is from my grandmother and has been handed down in our family for generations. They are filled with white cheese, potatoes, and mushrooms.",
  "cuisine": "Polish",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Prepare filling: Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Cook and stir onions and mushrooms in hot oil until soft, about 15 minutes. Remove from heat and set aside."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Pass potatoes and farmer's cheese separately through a food grinder or food processor; place both in a large bowl. Add onion-mushroom mixture, sour cream, salt, and pepper; mix until well combined and set filling aside."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "Make dough: Place flour on a clean work surface and form a well in the center. Crack eggs into the well. Add butter and a few tablespoons warm water. Mix with your hands, gradually adding more warm water, 1 tablespoon at a time, as you go. Knead until dough is soft and smooth, adding more flour to the work surface as needed."
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "text": "Roll out 1/4 of the dough to an 1/8-inch thickness. Use a glass or round cookie cutter to cut out circles, saving any excess dough for your next batch. Place 1 teaspoon filling in the center of each dough circle. Fold dough over into a half-moon shape and pinch edges together to seal. Cover pierogi with a clean dish towel and repeat with remaining dough and filling."
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "text": "Bring a large pot of salted water to a gentle boil. Cook pierogi in batches, about 20 at a time, in boiling water until they float to the surface, 10 to 15 minutes. Remove with a slotted spoon to a strainer to drain."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 80,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 55,
  "preparation_time_minutes": 60,
